<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The affirmative vote of the holders of a majority
of the shares present and entitled to vote on the matter was required for approval. The proposal was approved.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

